{"title": "nr_requests 查看实测（Rocky 9, kernel 5.14）", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "cat /sys/block/vda/queue/nr_requests"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "256   # 虚拟盘默认 256"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "cat /sys/block/loop30/queue/nr_requests"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "128   # loop 盘默认 128，SATA/SAS 常见 128"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "NVMe 一般 1023/1024"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "动手前先记下这个基线值"}
]}
